      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a short summary for a civics class? it's about the legal tension between mandatory public health measures (like vaccines or masks) and individual rights. i need it to explain why these laws exist and what the main pushback is from people who don't want to follow them. just a few paragraphs so students can understand the debate.",
